<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>SOP Pengamanan Data & Sistem Saat Melakukan Update/Replace Source Code</title>
<style>
body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #000; }
h1 { font-size: 16pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
h2 { font-size: 13pt; color: #2F5496; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold; }
